Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.47,0:00:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that if I tormented\Nthese children long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd emerge from your\Nmusty hole sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time has been kind to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better, you\Ncould almost pass for human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, how cavalier you've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were nothing like this the\Nlast time I saw you, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so timid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, when you stood before\Nme two centuries ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your teeth couldn't stop chattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, Lycerus?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not call me by that name, Quinella.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a program with one\Ndirective, deleting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.33,0:00:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, my name is Administrator, and\Nmy directive is to manage all programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it took so long\Nfor us to meet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you see, I was preparing\Na special art to welcome you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and finishing it took\Nlonger than expected.
