Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cut the address loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came so close to killing you 200 years\Nago, but I let you slip through my fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I wanted to make sure\Nthat didn't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I learned from my mistake\Nand came up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.93,0:01:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was lure you out again\Nand trap you on this side, with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a mouse in the same cage with a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, it is not clear who\Nis the mouse and who is the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are trapped in here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as you can plainly see, there\Nare four of us, and only one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four against one, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.47,0:01:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your numbers are off by a\Nwide margin, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, and this does not\Ninclude myself, mind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's four against three hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three hundred? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.05,0:02:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You vile monster, is there\Nno limit to your depravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your duty is to protect your\Nsubjects and you turn them into that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, subjects?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, that monster at\Nits core, this human?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say such silly things about trifles\Nsuch as duties and subjects to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no problem as\Nlong as whatever I rule
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over remains subservient\Nand obeys my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.45,0:02:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether they be sword or\Nhuman matters not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You horrid! Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now don't tell me you're\Nshocked that I used a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little thing like matter\Nconversion on human units.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only a measly 300 or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is just a prototype, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to mass-produce the final version
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in sufficient numbers\Nto handle the load test,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect I will need...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, about half. Half? Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, naturally, of the 80,000 human\Nunits living in the Human Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that amount should\Nbe enough, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To repel the armies of the Dark Territory\Nand take the fight back to their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope that allays\Nyour fears, little Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your precious human empire will be\Nmore than protected, Madam Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is clear my words cannot reach you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, as a fellow sacred arts user,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to know\Nwhere the owners are of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the 30 swords you\Nfashioned that monstrosity?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you flouted the rule allowing\Nperfect control over one weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pontifex or no, you cannot\Nbreak the next rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To activate memory release,\Nthere must be a bond
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between the weapon and its owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pontifex,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you truly used innocent humans as the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,source of the blades\Nwhich make up that thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is no way they\Nwould form a bond with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The explanation is hiding\Nin plain sight, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo seems to have already discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See the crystals on the ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're what she stole from the\NKnights with the Synthesis Ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are their memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Queen Ella!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:04:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toying like this with the\Nhumans is beyond twisted!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You placed the memory fragments you stole\Ninto mental models on fresh light cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all it would take to\Ncreate simulated human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But their intelligence\Nwould be severely limited,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.57,0:05:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they would not be able to\Nexecute an advanced command?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such as perfect weapon control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can get around that\Nif the memory fragment and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the weapon it is linked to\Nshare the same structural data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The memories of people the\Nknights once held dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The memories you stole and\Ncarved onto these crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are what your golem is made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These artificial personas\Ndesire but one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find the one they remember,\Ntouch them, hold them, possess them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unseemly desire courses throughout this\Npuppet and provides its motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.07,0:05:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sense the ones they remember\Nare near, but they cannot touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They cannot be one with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their thirst for that connection\Ndrives them to the point of madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all they can see now are the\Nenemies standing in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think if they can destroy you,\Nthe one they desire will become theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why they fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no matter how badly they're\Nwounded, or how many times they fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll keep fighting for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I designed it rather well, did I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of desire can achieve\Ngreat things if harnessed properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare tarnish that\Nemotion by calling it desire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What they feel is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is pure love!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now you're just\Nsplitting hairs, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love is control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love is desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, it is a signal produced\Nby a Fluctlight, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which brings us to an\Neven greater revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you know the truth about my\Nfearsome puppet, you cannot destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because every single\Nblade is a living human
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being who has been\Ntransformed into a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot kill a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent the past 200 years owning an\Nart to kill you and your inhuman form,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are such a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's both funny and tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew that all life\Nin this world was just
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a collection of data\Nthat can be rewritten,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yet you treat it as human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did, because they are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people of the Underworld have the\Nemotions you and I lost, Quinella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:08:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can laugh, grieve,\Nfeel joy, and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what makes them human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will let you take my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I want your word that\Nyou will spare these young ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of curiosity, let us\Nsay I accepted your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would I stand to gain from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you decide to fight, I will not\Nonly keep your pathetic puppet at bay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will shave off at least\Nhalf of your life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loss of that would put an even greater
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strain on your already\Ndwindling memory capacity,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting them go now gives me\Nsomething to look forward to later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:09:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I swear on the goddess\NStacia, after I kill - No, not on a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll swear on the one\Nthing you value most.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Fluctlight, or the deal is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby swear on my\NFluctlight and all the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,precious data I've accumulated up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.23,0:09:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I've killed you, little one, I shall\Nallow those three to escape unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire all you want, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding back for now, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, what fun would it\Nbe if I dispatched you quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting 200\Nyears for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can do is stand here. Powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:11:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of whining about being\Nweak, find a way to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, to finish our centuries-long game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, dear Lycerin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my only daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my other self!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have a mission\Nto fulfill, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of you will save this\Nworld, fragile and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:11:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have given me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I shall use it to defend this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what my purpose is supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay and fulfill my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.49,0:12:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With whatever strength you have left,\NI want you to turn me into a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like her puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuji-ho, you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if she lets us go, Administrator will\Nstill change half the people into golems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let her do that to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's any chance left to stop her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any hope left at all, this\Nsacred art must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remove core protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bond between us is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much stronger than her and\Nthat monster's. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I was meant to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.71,0:13:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:14:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final art I cast in life\Nwill go toward your objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I go, I need to\Ntell you one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal weapons don't work on the Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.27,0:14:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's why I couldn't\Nstab her with my dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you die already? No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your lightning will not work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You insolent little knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall burn all three of you to cinders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I shall stop you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release, recollection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can mimic my spell, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, one paltry sword is no match\Nagainst my Golem of Thirty Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will snap it in half\Nwith a single blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Human love, beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the shining light of\Npurpose, so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, I must go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect this world and its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pucho.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight some more, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not make the mistake\Nof becoming overconfident
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.37,0:17:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just because you demolished my puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.13,0:17:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Richard Craig!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In terms of priority level,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sword that fused with Eugeo was no\Nmatch for my blade, the Silvery Eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I did not realize his\Nsword was not metallic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it seems you are\Nthe last one standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprising, to say the least,\Nboy from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still curious as to why you're\Nhere without administrator privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although at this point, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the fight is over, I'm sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ask the other boy from the\Nouter world why you were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after I fill my chamber\Nwith your blood and screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we will meet again\Nsomeday on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm letting it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do not have to win all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you lose, what does it even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, what does is that your\Nheart and will are remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.99,0:20:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am certain everyone\Nwho has spent time with
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.49,0:20:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and moved on to other\Nplanes believed that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:20:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:21:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have given you the strength to stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stand and protect those you hold dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.59,0:21:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now, you can move, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish, have had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought hard, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charlotte, Cardinal, and Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They gave their lives for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.89,0:21:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll give mine for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.67,0:22:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love you.
